<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Protexta extends Euro paper program.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Protexta extends Euro paper program.</headline>
<dateline>MONTERREY, Mexico 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction company Protexa Construcciones said on Monday it has renewed for two years a $150 million line of commercial Euro paper.</p>
<p>The privately-held company first placed the paper in 1993.</p>
<p>Protexa said it has placed 21 commerical Euro paper issues worth a total of $300 million.</p>
<p>((-- Marlene Galvan, Monterrey bureau, +528 345-7553))</p>
</text>
